      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب برای کودکان شرط، محدودیت سنی یا نکته دارد؛ جمله برچسب در زیر آمده است.",
        "en": "The label has conditions, age limits or notes for children; the label sentence is quoted below."
      },
      "quote": "Aminoglycosides should be used with caution in premature and neonatal infants because of the renal immaturity of these patients and the resulting prolongation of serum half-life of these drugs.",
